#: rc.cpp:29
msgid "Use window &class (whole application)"
msgstr "Koristi &klasu prozora (cio program)"

#. i18n: file: detectwidget.ui:174
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QRadioButton, use_role)
#: rc.cpp:32
msgid ""
"For selecting a specific window in an application, both window class and "
"window role should be selected. Window class will determine the application, "
"and window role the specific window in the application; many applications do "
"not provide useful window roles though."
msgstr ""
"Za izbor posebnog prozora unutar programa moraju biti zadate i klasa i uloga "
"prozora. Klasa će odrediti program, a uloga izdvojiti prozor unutar njega. "
"Na žalost, mnogi programi ne navode svojim prozorima korisne uloge."

#. i18n: file: detectwidget.ui:177
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, use_role)
#: rc.cpp:35
msgid "Use window class and window &role (specific window)"
msgstr "Koristi klasu &i ulogu prozora (poseban prozor)"

#. i18n: file: detectwidget.ui:184
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QRadioButton, use_whole_class)
#: rc.cpp:38
msgid ""
"With some (non-KDE) applications whole window class can be sufficient for "
"selecting a specific window in an application, as they set whole window "
"class to contain both application and window role."
msgstr ""
"Za neke (ne-KDE) programe, cijela klasa prozora može biti dovoljna za izbor "
"posebnog prozora unutar programa, jer neki programi u klasu prozora umeću i "
"njegovu ulogu."

#. i18n: file: detectwidget.ui:187
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, use_whole_class)
#: rc.cpp:41
msgid "Use &whole window class (specific window)"
msgstr "Koristi &cijelu klasu prozora (poseban prozor)"

